# Next.js 16.2.6 + Vercel

**Stack:** Next.js **16.2.6** (exact pin — без ADR не менять), React 19, TypeScript 5  
**Guidelines:** `docs/guidelines/nextjs/` (создаётся в R01-CU6)  
**Reference:** `docs/examples/ai_first_tmp/.cursor/rules/tiers/t1-implementation/nextjs-vercel-app-router.mdc`

## Version pin

```json
"next": "16.2.6"
```

Pin matching `eslint-config-next` to the same patch. No Next.js 15 patterns.

## Request interception — `proxy.ts`

| Next.js 15 | Next.js 16.2.6 |
|------------|----------------|
| `middleware.ts` | **`proxy.ts`** |
| `export function middleware()` | **`export async function proxy()`** |
| Edge runtime | **Node.js** in proxy |

- Auth in proxy: **only** `server/auth/auth.config.ts` — never `server/auth/auth.ts` (Prisma).
- Do not add new auth gates in `middleware.ts`.

## Required practices

- **Async Request APIs:** `await cookies()`, `await headers()`, `await params`, `await searchParams`
- **Server Components by default** — `'use client'` only for hooks, browser APIs, Zustand, Framer Motion
- **Thin BFF:** Route Handlers / Server Actions → DAL `server/**` и `games/<slug>/server/**` (см. **data-server-actions-and-api**)
- **Cache invalidation:** `revalidateTag`, `revalidatePath`, `redirect` after mutations
- **Cross-request reads:** prefer React `cache()` in request scope; `'use cache'` / PPR / Instant Navigations — **не включено** (отдельный ADR при необходимости)

## Структура маршрутов (текущая; целевая — `repo_structure_contract.md` §1)

```
app/          — маршруты, layouts
app/(game)/   — публичная игра
app/admin/**  — admin (role gate в proxy)
app/api/**    — Auth.js + Admin API
components/   — клиентские UI (`'use client'`)
server/**     — auth и Prisma singleton (`server-only`)
games/<slug>/server/** — DAL и Server Actions игры
```

## Запрещено

- `import { useRouter } from 'next/router'` → `next/navigation`
- `getServerSideProps` / Pages Router data APIs
- `new PrismaClient()` вне `server/db/client.ts`
- `import { auth } from '@/server/auth/auth'` в `proxy.ts`
- Обязательное `cacheComponents: true` / Instant Navigations без ADR
